{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1569888000, "end_date": 1572566399, "month_true_total": 4, "quota": 4, "returned": 4, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:04:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "56077533", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165297818", "personaname": "ChiWa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ATRPAAA/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 76794, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 240, "playtime_at_review": 15762, "last_played": 1788057203, "avatar": "236caf4df5cd405840c6f01ca849e8bd345fb90e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "gRaNdEee", "timestamp_created": 1572564935, "timestamp_updated": 1669140154, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55757803", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040005010", "personaname": "Arisanick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Arisanick/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 719, "playtime_forever": 8792, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2476, "last_played": 1771338129, "avatar": "9a435c60ca85fdcbe078eac5c09a938d00a751e7"}, "language": "spanish", "review": " A pesar de estar en Early, tiene mucho que ofrecer y lo ha hecho bastante bien:\n Mineria cooperativa, con enanos ultra mamados que combaten super insectos gigantes, y biomas bastante peligrosos, como los que te congelan y debes buscar geiseres para entrar en calor, o las que carecen de oxigeno y debes estar llamando a tu MULE, a cada rato.\n Si juegas solo, no importa. Tienes a un robot armadisimo hasta los dientes llamado Bosco, que tiene la capacidad de lanzar misiles y sus ametralladoras, son efectivas, aun en el vuelo; tambien excava y te puede ayudar a extraer hasta los minerales, mas duros y los que estan en lugares inalcanzables, sin contar su buenisima velocidad para trabajar.\n En fin, muy buen juego cooperativo.", "timestamp_created": 1571984977, "timestamp_updated": 1571984977, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55501017", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121175214", "personaname": "Squoshy!", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Squoshy1/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 8288, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1291, "last_played": 1779647952, "avatar": "0f46c0b01872dd84978340b3d9bd7ce405246a17"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Muy bueno y buenisima ambientacion (cuando jugás solo, podés sentir esa sensación de soledad, casi como pasa en el Sea Of Thieves). Tanto en solitario como con amigos -y extraños también- este juego es absolutamente disfrutable y saca tu lado comunista al punto que a veces no puedo dejar de apretar la \"V\". Lo único que le falta es un poco de optimización, pero aún asi es posible jugarlo sin problema alguno.\n\n¡Rock and Stone, brother!", "timestamp_created": 1570480628, "timestamp_updated": 1575608079, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55383460", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034091981", "personaname": "Nacho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198034091981/", "num_games_owned": 1054, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 12261, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2243, "last_played": 1771981959, "avatar": "95897c554a9247969f75cea7d23441094d893f2f"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Uno de los mejores juegos cooperativos que he jugado, donde justamente cooperar es fundamental. Y ademas super divertido con todo lo que van agregando en las actualizaciones, da gusto un acceso anticipado asi!", "timestamp_created": 1569949764, "timestamp_updated": 1569949764, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}